window.GUIDE_DATA = {"Enhancement":{"spec":"Enhancement","role":{"es":"DPS cuerpo a cuerpo","en":"Melee DPS"},"summary":{"es":"Arma a dos manos, rayos y totems: peleás cuerpo a cuerpo con Windfury, Stormstrike (100% del daño del arma cada 8 s) potencia tu próximo hechizo de Naturaleza, y Maelstrom Weapon te da Lightning Bolts instantáneos. Desde el hotfix del 10-nov la Fuerza y el poder de ataque son tu daño, y Windfury Weapon y Windfury Totem funcionan a la vez.","en":"Two-handed weapon, lightning and totems: you fight in melee with Windfury, Stormstrike (100% weapon damage every 8 sec) empowers your next Nature spell, and Maelstrom Weapon gives you instant Lightning Bolts. Since the Nov 10 hotfix Strength and attack power are your damage, and Windfury Weapon and Windfury Totem work at the same time."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Armas a dos manos de base; dual wield sin confirmar","en":"Two-handed weapons baseline; dual wield unconfirmed"},"detail":{"es":"Hachas y mazas a dos manos vienen de base (por eso desapareció el talento Two-Handed Axes and Maces). En Classic Era el Shaman nunca tuvo dual wield, y en el cliente de Forever tampoco hay hechizo, talento ni entrenador que lo enseñe. Wowhead reporta que el spec está pensado para un arma a dos manos.","en":"Two-handed axes and maces are baseline (which is why the Two-Handed Axes and Maces talent is gone). Classic Era Shamans never had dual wield, and the Forever client has no spell, talent or trainer that teaches it either. Wowhead reports the spec is designed around a two-handed weapon."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/enhancement-only-uses-2-handed-weapons-in-wow-forever-enhancement-shaman-383200"},{"change":{"es":"Hotfix del 10-nov: Enhancement vuelve al Windfury","en":"Nov 10 hotfix: Enhancement goes back to Windfury"},"detail":{"es":"Blizzard deshizo varios cambios de la beta que llevaban a Enhancement a equiparse con Intelecto y poder con hechizos: Stormstrike baja a 100% del arma cada 8 s, Mental Dexterity a 33/66/100% del Intelecto, y Maelstrom Weapon salta menos. A cambio, los encantamientos de arma y los totems de arma ahora funcionan a la vez: Windfury Weapon y Windfury Totem tiran su chance por separado en cada golpe. Lo hicieron antes de que abran los raids para que nadie gane piezas que después pierdan valor. En nuestra simulación (WoWSims con el hotfix cargado, nivel 60) Enhancement pierde ~12% de daño si pasa a Windfury Weapon + Windfury Totem, y ~15% si no cambia nada.","en":"Blizzard undid several beta changes that pushed Enhancement into Intellect and spell power gear: Stormstrike drops to 100% weapon damage every 8 sec, Mental Dexterity to 33/66/100% of Intellect, and Maelstrom Weapon procs less. In exchange, weapon imbues and weapon totems now work at the same time: Windfury Weapon and Windfury Totem each roll their chance on every hit. They did it before raids open so nobody wins pieces that lose value later. In our sim (WoWSims with the hotfix loaded, level 60) Enhancement loses ~12% damage if it moves to Windfury Weapon + Windfury Totem, and ~15% if it changes nothing."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040"},{"change":{"es":"Stormstrike: 100% del arma cada 8 s","en":"Stormstrike: 100% weapon damage every 8 sec"},"detail":{"es":"Golpe instantáneo de 100% del daño del arma (normalizado) que sube 20% el daño de tu próximo Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning o Earth Shock contra ese objetivo por 12 s. 8 s de CD. Era 150% cada 6 s desde las notas del 2-nov; el hotfix del 10-nov lo bajó, y es la parte más grande del nerf (~9% de tu daño en la simulación). Fila 4 (nivel 25). Improved Stormstrike (fila 5) suma 50% de regeneración de maná al lanzar por 15 s y reinicia el CD cuando esquivás o parás.","en":"An instant strike for 100% weapon damage (normalized) that raises the damage of your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock against that target by 20% for 12 sec. 8 sec cooldown. It was 150% every 6 sec since the Nov 2 notes; the Nov 10 hotfix lowered it, and it is the largest part of the nerf (~9% of your damage in the sim). Row 4 (level 25). Improved Stormstrike (row 5) adds 50% mana regen while casting for 15 sec and resets the cooldown when you dodge or parry."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040"},{"change":{"es":"El Intelecto rinde menos","en":"Intellect pays less"},"detail":{"es":"Mental Dexterity (3/3) da poder de ataque igual al 100% de tu Intelecto (33/66/100% por punto; era 150% hasta el hotfix del 10-nov) y abre Flurry. Mental Quickness (2/2) da poder con hechizos y curación hasta 30% de tu Intelecto. Ancestral Knowledge es +10% de Intelecto. Ahora 1 de Intelecto ≈ 1 de poder de ataque, menos que 1 de Fuerza: juntá Fuerza.","en":"Mental Dexterity (3/3) gives attack power equal to 100% of your Intellect (33/66/100% per point; 150% until the Nov 10 hotfix) and opens Flurry. Mental Quickness (2/2) gives spell damage and healing up to 30% of your Intellect. Ancestral Knowledge is +10% Intellect. Now 1 Intellect ≈ 1 attack power, less than 1 Strength: collect Strength."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040"},{"change":{"es":"Maelstrom Weapon: cada punto, más seguido","en":"Maelstrom Weapon: each point, more often"},"detail":{"es":"Tus golpes cuerpo a cuerpo acumulan hasta 5 cargas; cada carga baja 20% el tiempo de lanzamiento y el maná de tu próximo Lightning Bolt, con cualquier cantidad de puntos (5 cargas = instantáneo y gratis). Desde el hotfix del 10-nov los puntos cambian la frecuencia: 6/7/8/9/10 veces por minuto (antes 20 por minuto siempre, y los puntos cambiaban el % por carga). La chance por golpe sube con la velocidad del arma: con 5/5 y un arma de 3.6, 60% por golpe. En la simulación el primer punto vale ~6% de tu daño y cada uno de los otros ~0,9%: más que cualquier otro lugar donde ponerlos.","en":"Your melee hits build up to 5 stacks; each stack cuts 20% off the cast time and mana of your next Lightning Bolt, at any number of points (5 stacks = instant and free). Since the Nov 10 hotfix the points set the rate: 6/7/8/9/10 times per minute (before, 20 per minute always, and the points set the % per stack). The chance per hit rises with weapon speed: at 5/5 with a 3.6 weapon, 60% per hit. In the sim the first point is worth ~6% of your damage and each of the others ~0.9%: more than anywhere else you could put them."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040"},{"change":{"es":"Flurry, Rage of the Farseer y Spirit Weapons","en":"Flurry, Rage of the Farseer and Spirit Weapons"},"detail":{"es":"Flurry da 30% de velocidad de ataque por 3 golpes tras un crítico (en la beta era 25%). Rage of the Farseer (fila 7): +30% de velocidad de ataque por 25 s, 3 min de CD, y ya no afecta hechizos. Spirit Weapons: chance de parar y control de amenaza (−30% sin Rockbiter, más amenaza con Rockbiter). Windfury Weapon y Windfury Totem: desde el hotfix del 10-nov funcionan a la vez (ver arriba).","en":"Flurry gives 30% attack speed for 3 swings after a crit (25% in the beta). Rage of the Farseer (row 7): +30% attack speed for 25 sec, 3 min cooldown, and it no longer affects spells. Spirit Weapons: a chance to parry and a threat switch (−30% without Rockbiter, more threat with Rockbiter). Windfury Weapon and Windfury Totem: since the Nov 10 hotfix they work at the same time (see above)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Quest de arma al nivel 30","en":"Level 30 weapon quest"},"detail":{"es":"Después de Call of Air (el totem de aire, nivel 30) sigue una cadena nueva de Forever que termina en The Tempest's Weapons: Rage of the Storm (maza a dos manos, +10% de daño de Stormstrike) o dos armas de puño, y para Alianza también un escudo. La cadena te manda a Razorfen Kraul y a Badlands, Swamp of Sorrows, Desolace y Dustwallow, así que en la práctica el arma llega entre el 33 y el 37. Equipo › Tu camino la muestra con la cadena de tu facción.","en":"After Call of Air (the air totem, level 30) comes a new Forever chain ending in The Tempest's Weapons: Rage of the Storm (two-handed mace, +10% Stormstrike damage) or two fist weapons, and for the Alliance a shield too. The chain sends you to Razorfen Kraul and to Badlands, Swamp of Sorrows, Desolace and Dustwallow, so in practice the weapon arrives between 33 and 37. Equipo › Your path shows it with your faction's chain."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/unlock-powerful-weapons-with-level-30-shaman-quest-in-wow-forever-383290"},{"change":{"es":"Totem de aire: Windfury Totem","en":"Air totem: Windfury Totem"},"detail":{"es":"Desde el hotfix del 10-nov tu Windfury Weapon ya no anula el Windfury Totem: cada golpe tira la chance de los dos por separado. En nuestra simulación (solo, nivel 60 contra un bicho 2 niveles arriba) Windfury Totem te rinde 8% más que Grace of Air, y sumarlo al encantamiento es lo que más compensa el nerf del 10-nov. Windfury Totem sale al 32. En un grupo con otro Shaman, que uno ponga Grace of Air y el otro Windfury.","en":"Since the Nov 10 hotfix your Windfury Weapon no longer cancels Windfury Totem: every hit rolls both chances separately. In our sim (solo, level 60 against a mob 2 levels above) Windfury Totem gives you 8% more than Grace of Air, and stacking it with the imbue is what makes up most for the Nov 10 nerf. Windfury Totem comes at 32. In a group with another Shaman, one drops Grace of Air and the other Windfury."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Weapon Damage","Hit","Critical Strike","Strength","Intellect","Agility"],"confidence":"client-data","rationale":{"es":"Medido en WoWSims con el hotfix del 10-nov cargado, en poder de ataque por punto. Subiendo de nivel solo (bicho 2 niveles arriba, sin golpe en el equipo): índice de golpe 5,1 hasta no fallar más (6% contra +2), crítico 2,75, Fuerza 2,2, Intelecto 1,9 (2,9 si te quedás sin maná a mitad de pelea), poder con hechizos 1,5, Agilidad 1,35. En raid (jefe 3 niveles arriba): Fuerza 2,2, crítico 2,9, golpe 2,5 (los hechizos siguen fallando hasta 17%), Intelecto 2,0, poder con hechizos 1,5. Primero el daño del arma (se compara por DPS y conviene lenta). Equipo › Tu camino usa estos pesos.","en":"Measured in WoWSims with the Nov 10 hotfix loaded, in attack power per point. Leveling solo (mob 2 levels above, no hit on gear): hit rating 5.1 until you stop missing (6% against +2), crit 2.75, Strength 2.2, Intellect 1.9 (2.9 if you run out of mana mid-fight), spell power 1.5, Agility 1.35. In raid (boss 3 levels above): Strength 2.2, crit 2.9, hit 2.5 (spells keep missing up to 17%), Intellect 2.0, spell power 1.5. First the weapon's damage (judged by DPS, and slow is better). Equipo › Your path uses these weights."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: con Mental Dexterity 3/3 cada punto de Intelecto da 1 de poder de ataque (era 1,5 hasta el 10-nov), Ancestral Knowledge lo sube 10%, Mental Quickness convierte 30% en poder con hechizos y el Intelecto además es tu maná. Como la mitad de tu daño sale de hechizos (Earth Shock, Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt, Fire Nova, Magma Totem), el Intelecto todavía vale más que la Agilidad. Pero la Fuerza vale más que los dos, y el golpe y el crítico todavía más: una pieza de Fuerza le gana a una de tela de caster del mismo nivel. La simulación no cuenta la armadura: a igual daño, quedate con la malla o el cuero.","en":"Forever-specific: with Mental Dexterity 3/3 each point of Intellect gives 1 attack power (1.5 until Nov 10), Ancestral Knowledge raises it 10%, Mental Quickness turns 30% into spell power and Intellect is also your mana. Since half your damage comes from spells (Earth Shock, Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt, Fire Nova, Magma Totem), Intellect is still worth more than Agility. But Strength is worth more than both, and hit and crit more still: a Strength piece beats a cloth caster piece of the same level. The sim doesn't count armor: at equal damage, keep the mail or leather."},"confidence":"client-data"}},"rotation":{"level30":[{"es":"Mantené Lightning Shield y tu imbue, y Strength of Earth y Searing Totem puestos (renovalos cuando se terminen). La amenaza extra de Rockbiter importa si hay un tanque sosteniendo al objetivo.","en":"Keep Lightning Shield and your imbue up, and Strength of Earth and Searing Totem down (renew them when they run out). Rockbiter's extra threat matters if a tank is holding the target."},{"es":"Desde el 25, Stormstrike cada 8 s, cada vez que salga: pega fuerte y potencia tu próximo hechizo de Naturaleza.","en":"From 25, Stormstrike every 8 sec, whenever it's up: it hits hard and empowers your next Nature spell."},{"es":"Flame Shock siempre activo en un objetivo que aguante sus ticks, y Earth Shock como golpe de daño entre medio (así lo usa la simulación). Si el enemigo lanza algo peligroso, guardate uno para cortarlo.","en":"Flame Shock always up on a target that lives through its ticks, and Earth Shock as a damage hit in between (that's how the sim uses it). If the enemy casts something dangerous, keep one to interrupt it."},{"es":"Con maná de sobra, Fire Nova de relleno: también contra grupos.","en":"With mana to spare, Fire Nova as filler: against packs too."},{"es":"Al 30, pasate a Windfury Weapon: desde el 10-nov funciona junto con el Windfury Totem (desde el 32), y en la simulación es tu mejor encantamiento.","en":"At 30, switch to Windfury Weapon: since Nov 10 it works together with Windfury Totem (from 32), and in the sim it is your best imbue."}],"confidence":"client-data","totems":["Strength of Earth Totem","Searing Totem","Mana Spring Totem"],"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman/enhancement","level60":[{"es":"Windfury Weapon en el arma y totems siempre arriba: Windfury Totem, Strength of Earth, Mana Spring y Magma Totem pegado al objetivo (así lo usa la simulación). Water Shield activo.","en":"Windfury Weapon on your weapon and totems always up: Windfury Totem, Strength of Earth, Mana Spring and Magma Totem next to the target (the sim does it this way). Water Shield active."},{"es":"Flame Shock siempre activo en el objetivo.","en":"Flame Shock always up on the target."},{"es":"Stormstrike cada vez que salga (cada 8 s).","en":"Stormstrike whenever it's up (every 8 sec)."},{"es":"Con Maelstrom Weapon en 5 cargas, Lightning Bolt (sale instantáneo y gratis).","en":"With Maelstrom Weapon at 5 stacks, Lightning Bolt (instant and free)."},{"es":"Earth Shock de relleno y Fire Nova cuando esté lista: en Forever pega fuerte y Trial by Fire le baja el tiempo de reutilización.","en":"Earth Shock as filler and Fire Nova whenever it's ready: in Forever it hits hard and Trial by Fire lowers its cooldown."}],"level60Confidence":"client-data"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Windfury es un proc: armá el equipo para la pelea completa, no para el golpe extra más grande.","en":"Windfury is a proc: gear for the whole fight, not for the biggest extra hit."},"confidence":"classic-assumed"},{"note":{"es":"Después del hotfix del 10-nov la Fuerza es tu mejor stat principal, pero el Intelecto y el poder con hechizos siguen sumando daño (Earth Shock, Flame Shock, Fire Nova, Lightning Bolt): una pieza con Fuerza y algo de Intelecto es lo ideal, como pidió Blizzard.","en":"After the Nov 10 hotfix Strength is your best main stat, but Intellect and spell power still add damage (Earth Shock, Flame Shock, Fire Nova, Lightning Bolt): a piece with Strength and some Intellect is ideal, as Blizzard asked."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Los imbues duran 60 minutos (antes 5).","en":"Imbues last 60 minutes (was 5)."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"Builds simulados después del hotfix del 10-nov (WoWSims con el hotfix cargado por nosotros): Leveling 10→60 (17/31/3, con Improved Ghost Wolf hasta tener montura) y Raid a 60 (17/31/3, el recomendado). Comparados con los builds populares de la comunidad, rinden 3-5% más. El de PvP lo armamos con criterio, sin simular. Lo que más importa: Maelstrom Weapon 5/5 (el primer punto vale ~6% de tu daño), Trial by Fire (Fire Nova) y Tidal Focus para el golpe.","en":"Builds simulated after the Nov 10 hotfix (WoWSims with the hotfix loaded by us): Leveling 10→60 (17/31/3, with Improved Ghost Wolf until you have a mount) and Raid at 60 (17/31/3, the recommended one). Compared with the community's popular builds, they do 3-5% more. The PvP one we built by judgment, not simmed. What matters most: Maelstrom Weapon 5/5 (the first point is worth ~6% of your damage), Trial by Fire (Fire Nova) and Tidal Focus for hit."}},"sources":["https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2404092","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/9","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-leveling","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/enhancement/","https://wowforevertalents.com/shaman/builds/enhancement-11-33-0-0c2de0/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/builds","https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman","https://github.com/wowsims/forever","https://conquestcapped.com/guides/wow-forever/wow-forever-hit-cap/","https://mmonster.co/wow-forever/guides/stats"],"caveat":{"es":"WoW: Forever en vivo (lanzamiento 4-nov-2026, tope 60), con las notas del 2-nov y los hotfixes hasta el 10-nov. Los números de talentos y stats salen de WoWSims para Forever con el hotfix del 10-nov cargado por nosotros (WoWSims todavía no lo tiene), a nivel 60: una pelea de 3 minutos contra un objetivo 2 niveles arriba (leveo, solo) o 3 niveles arriba (jefe de raid, con buffs de raid). Leveando, adaptá la rotación al bicho que tengas enfrente.","en":"WoW: Forever live (launched Nov 4, 2026, level cap 60), with the notes of Nov 2 and the hotfixes up to Nov 10. Talent and stat numbers come from WoWSims for Forever with the Nov 10 hotfix loaded by us (WoWSims doesn't have it yet), at level 60: a 3-minute fight against a target 2 levels above (leveling, solo) or 3 levels above (raid boss, with raid buffs). Leveling, adapt the rotation to whatever you're fighting."},"keyTalents":[{"es":"Stormstrike (fila 4, nivel 25) — 100% del daño del arma y +20% a tu próximo Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning o Earth Shock, cada 8 s","en":"Stormstrike (row 4, level 25) — 100% weapon damage and +20% to your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock, every 8 sec"},{"es":"Mental Dexterity — 100% de tu Intelecto como poder de ataque; abre Flurry","en":"Mental Dexterity — 100% of your Intellect as attack power; opens Flurry"},{"es":"Maelstrom Weapon — cada carga, 20% menos tiempo de lanzamiento y maná para Lightning Bolt; 5 cargas = instantáneo y gratis; cada punto la hace saltar más seguido","en":"Maelstrom Weapon — each stack, 20% less cast time and mana for Lightning Bolt; 5 stacks = instant and free; each point makes it proc more often"},{"es":"Improved Stormstrike — 50% de regeneración de maná al lanzar hechizos por 15 s tras Stormstrike, y Stormstrike se reinicia al esquivar o parar","en":"Improved Stormstrike — 50% mana regen while casting for 15 sec after Stormstrike, and Stormstrike resets when you dodge or parry"},{"es":"Rage of the Farseer (fila 7) — +30% de velocidad de ataque por 25 s","en":"Rage of the Farseer (row 7) — +30% attack speed for 25 sec"}],"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: el DPS más alto que consigas, y lenta (3,3 a 3,8 s). Stormstrike y Windfury pegan por golpe, así que cada golpe grande rinde más; un arma rápida con un poco más de DPS no compensa.","en":"Weapon: the highest DPS you can get, and slow (3.3 to 3.8 sec). Stormstrike and Windfury hit per swing, so each big hit pays more; a fast weapon with slightly more DPS doesn't make up for it."},"confidence":"community-untested"},{"note":{"es":"Después del arma: índice de golpe hasta no fallar (6% contra bichos 2 niveles arriba; en raid, 8% para golpes y 17% para hechizos), Fuerza y crítico (mantiene Flurry activo). La Agilidad rinde menos por punto que la Fuerza.","en":"After the weapon: hit rating until you stop missing (6% against mobs 2 levels above; in raid, 8% for melee and 17% for spells), Strength and crit (keeps Flurry up). Agility pays less per point than Strength."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Varias armas a dos manos nuevas de Forever traen Fuerza + poder con hechizos (Charged Mithril Battleaxe, Thorium Greatmace, Stormcarver): es lo que Blizzard dice que quiere para Enhancement, \"Fuerza o poder de ataque con algo de Intelecto o poder con hechizos\".","en":"Several new Forever two-handers carry Strength + spell power (Charged Mithril Battleaxe, Thorium Greatmace, Stormcarver): it's what Blizzard says it wants for Enhancement, \"Strength or Attack Power, along with some Intellect and/or Spell Power\"."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Cómo funciona el golpe en Forever: un solo stat para golpes y hechizos (10 de índice = 1% al 60). Fallo base de golpes 5% contra tu nivel, 6% contra 2 niveles arriba y 8% contra un jefe calavera; de hechizos 4%, 6% y 17%, sin el mínimo de 1% de Classic. El golpe no quita la esquiva (~6%) ni los golpes de refilón (30% de tus golpes normales contra +2, 40% contra un jefe). Tidal Focus da 1% por punto. Así lo modela WoWSims y coinciden las guías de Forever; contra jefes de nivel 63 nadie lo probó todavía (los raids abren el 9-dic).","en":"How hit works in Forever: one stat for melee and spells (10 rating = 1% at 60). Base melee miss 5% against your level, 6% against 2 levels above and 8% against a skull boss; spells 4%, 6% and 17%, with no 1% floor as in Classic. Hit doesn't remove dodge (~6%) or glancing blows (30% of your white swings against +2, 40% against a boss). Tidal Focus gives 1% per point. That's how WoWSims models it and Forever guides agree; against level 63 bosses nobody has tested it yet (raids open Dec 9)."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Elemental":{"spec":"Elemental","role":{"es":"DPS a distancia / caster","en":"Ranged DPS / caster"},"summary":{"es":"Rayos desde lejos: Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning son tu daño, Call of Thunder les suma 5% de crítico y Lightning Overload te regala copias gratis. En Forever, Elemental Alacrity le saca 0,5 s a tus hechizos principales ya desde la fila 2, y Lightning Mastery (fila 7, nivel 40) los acelera todavía más. Desde las notas del 2-nov ya no hay Lava Burst: el fuego queda para Flame Shock y los totems. Ojo: el daño base bajó frente a Classic porque el poder con hechizos viene del equipo desde el nivel 10, así que el equipo pesa más que nunca.","en":"Lightning from range: Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning are your damage, Call of Thunder adds 5% crit to them and Lightning Overload throws in free copies. In Forever, Elemental Alacrity cuts 0.5 sec off your main spells as early as row 2, and Lightning Mastery (row 7, level 40) speeds them up even more. Since the notes of Nov 2 there is no Lava Burst: fire is left to Flame Shock and the totems. Note: base damage dropped compared to Classic because spell power comes from gear from level 10, so gear matters more than ever."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Sin Lava Burst: Call of Thunder y Lightning Mastery","en":"No Lava Burst: Call of Thunder and Lightning Mastery"},"detail":{"es":"Con las notas del 2-nov (en el juego desde el hotfix del 3-nov, antes del lanzamiento) Lava Burst sale del juego. En su lugar, en la fila 5, vuelve Call of Thunder: +5% de crítico a Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning (1 punto, nivel 30). El talento final (fila 7, nivel 40, pide Call of Thunder) es Lightning Mastery: durante 15 s le saca 0,5 s a Lightning Bolt y quita el CD de Chain Lightning. Lightning Bolt pega más en todos los rangos (el último, un 80% más) y Chain Lightning tarda 2,5 s y pega 145% de un Lightning Bolt del mismo rango.","en":"With the notes of Nov 2 (in game since the Nov 3 hotfix, before launch) Lava Burst leaves the game. In its place, on row 5, Call of Thunder is back: +5% crit to Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning (1 point, level 30). The final talent (row 7, level 40, needs Call of Thunder) is Lightning Mastery: for 15 sec it takes 0.5 sec off Lightning Bolt and removes Chain Lightning's cooldown. Lightning Bolt hits harder on every rank (the top one, 80% more) and Chain Lightning takes 2.5 sec and hits for 145% of a same-rank Lightning Bolt."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/9"},{"change":{"es":"Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning se lanzan más rápido","en":"Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning cast faster"},"detail":{"es":"Lightning Bolt rangos 4–10 se lanza en 2,5 s (Classic: 3 s); los rangos 1–3 no cambiaron. Chain Lightning: 2,5 s según las notas del 2-nov y el tooltip, aunque WoWSims lee 2 s en los archivos; fijate en el juego.","en":"Lightning Bolt ranks 4–10 cast in 2.5 sec (Classic: 3 sec); ranks 1–3 are unchanged. Chain Lightning: 2.5 sec according to the notes of Nov 2 and the tooltip, although WoWSims reads 2 sec in the files; check in game."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"data/shaman.json: class_abilities"},{"change":{"es":"Elemental Alacrity (ex Lightning Mastery) sube a la fila 2","en":"Elemental Alacrity (formerly Lightning Mastery) moves up to row 2"},"detail":{"es":"A 3/3 saca 0,5 s a Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning: un Lightning Bolt de 2 s ya cerca del nivel 20. En Classic estaba en la fila 6 (nivel 35). El nombre Lightning Mastery ahora es del talento final.","en":"At 3/3 it takes 0.5 sec off Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning: a 2 sec Lightning Bolt already around level 20. In Classic it was on row 6 (level 35). The name Lightning Mastery now belongs to the final talent."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Lightning Overload es nuevo (fila 5)","en":"Lightning Overload is new (row 5)"},"detail":{"es":"Pide Elemental Alacrity 3/3. 10/20/30% de chance (era 3/7/10%) de que Lightning Bolt o Chain Lightning lancen una copia gratis a la mitad de daño y sin amenaza. El hotfix del 9-nov arregló el daño de la copia de Lightning Bolt, que no había subido con los rangos nuevos.","en":"Needs Elemental Alacrity 3/3. A 10/20/30% chance (was 3/7/10%) for Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning to cast a free copy at half damage and no threat. The Nov 9 hotfix fixed the damage of the Lightning Bolt copy, which hadn't risen with the new ranks."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2403040"},{"change":{"es":"Earthbound: Earthbind enraíza","en":"Earthbound: Earthbind roots"},"detail":{"es":"Talento nuevo de 1 punto (fila 4): Earthbind Totem inmoviliza 5 s a lo que tenga cerca al caer.","en":"New 1-point talent (row 4): Earthbind Totem immobilizes nearby targets for 5 sec when it drops."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Cambios en el resto del árbol","en":"Changes across the rest of the tree"},"detail":{"es":"Improved Fire Nova ya no existe. Trial by Fire (fila 4, 2 puntos) es nuevo: +20% de daño a Fire Nova, 4 s menos de CD y 20 s más de Magma Totem. Elemental Fury: 5 puntos en la fila 6 (antes 1 en la 5), mismo 100%, pide Lightning Overload. Concussion ya solo afecta Earth Shock de los shocks. Call of Flame suma 15% a totems de fuego, Flame Shock y Fire Nova, y 9 s más de Flame Shock. Elemental Devastation sube a la fila 2 y se activa con críticos de hechizos de daño directo. Elemental Reach ya no baja el CD de Totemic Call.","en":"Improved Fire Nova is gone. Trial by Fire (row 4, 2 points) is new: +20% Fire Nova damage, 4 sec off its cooldown and 20 sec more Magma Totem. Elemental Fury: 5 points on row 6 (was 1 on row 5), same 100%, needs Lightning Overload. Concussion now only affects Earth Shock among the shocks. Call of Flame adds 15% to Fire totems, Flame Shock and Fire Nova, and 9 sec more Flame Shock. Elemental Devastation moves up to row 2 and triggers on direct damage spell crits. Elemental Reach no longer lowers Totemic Call's cooldown."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Fire Nova es un hechizo, no un totem","en":"Fire Nova is a spell, not a totem"},"detail":{"es":"30 m de alcance, instantáneo, 10 s de CD; explota alrededor de tu totem de fuego, con el mismo daño que tenía el totem y sin la espera de 4 s.","en":"30 yd range, instant, 10 sec cooldown; blasts around your Fire totem, for the same damage the totem had and without the 4 sec fuse."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"data/shaman.json: class_abilities"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Spell Power","Hit","Critical Strike","Intellect","Mana Regeneration (MP5)"],"confidence":"client-data","rationale":{"es":"Este orden es el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas: los pesos que WoWSims midió para Elemental en Forever (el daño de Naturaleza vale más que el de Fuego, por Lightning Bolt), ajustados para levear. El índice de golpe va antes que el crítico: un hechizo que falla no hace nada. El Intelecto y la regeneración pesan más que en una pelea de banda de tres minutos, porque leveando el maná sí se termina entre grupo y grupo.","en":"This is the order Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with: the weights WoWSims measured for Elemental in Forever (Nature damage counts more than Fire, for Lightning Bolt), adjusted for leveling. Hit comes before crit: a missed spell does nothing. Intellect and regeneration weigh more than in a three-minute raid fight, because leveling, your mana does run out between pulls."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","alsoReported":{"list":["Spell Power","Hit","Haste","Intellect","Critical Strike"],"confidence":"community-untested","note":{"es":"Icy Veins pone el crítico antes del golpe (daño de hechizos, crítico, golpe, Intelecto); WoWSims, al 60 y contra un jefe, le da más peso al golpe y la celeridad. Tomalo como variante de nivel alto, cuando el equipo y el cap de golpe pesen más.","en":"Icy Veins puts crit ahead of hit (spell damage, crit, hit, Intellect); WoWSims, at 60 against a boss, weights hit and haste higher. Treat it as a high-level variant, for when gear and the hit cap matter more."}},"forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: el daño base bajó y Blizzard puso poder con hechizos en el equipo desde el nivel 10, empezando por las armas. El poder con hechizos del arma pesa más que en Classic. Además Lightning Bolt (rangos 4–10) escala menos, 71,4% contra 85,7%.","en":"Forever-specific: base damage dropped and Blizzard put spell power on gear from level 10, starting with weapons. Weapon spell power matters more than in Classic. Lightning Bolt (ranks 4–10) also scales less, 71.4% against 85.7%."},"confidence":"official"}},"rotation":{"level30":[{"es":"Abrí de lejos con Lightning Bolt y poné Earthbind donde te dé otra ventana de lanzamiento.","en":"Open from range with Lightning Bolt and drop Earthbind where it buys you another cast window."},{"es":"Flame Shock y Searing Totem en objetivos que vivan lo suficiente para los ticks.","en":"Flame Shock and Searing Totem on targets that live long enough for the ticks."},{"es":"Earth Shock para interrumpir o como golpe directo, y Frost Shock si el objetivo se mueve y la ralentización importa.","en":"Earth Shock to interrupt or as a direct hit, and Frost Shock when the target moves and the slow matters."},{"es":"Seguí con Lightning Bolt en un solo objetivo; Fire Nova para grupos.","en":"Keep casting Lightning Bolt on a single target; Fire Nova for packs."}],"confidence":"client-data","level60":[{"es":"Flame Shock primero y renovalo antes de que se caiga, en objetivos que vivan sus ticks.","en":"Flame Shock first and renew it before it drops, on targets that live through its ticks."},{"es":"Lightning Mastery cada vez que esté disponible: 15 s de Lightning Bolt más rápido y Chain Lightning sin CD (en esos 15 s, Chain Lightning también contra uno solo si te sobra maná).","en":"Lightning Mastery whenever it's available: 15 sec of faster Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning without cooldown (during those 15 sec, Chain Lightning even on one target if you have mana to spare)."},{"es":"Chain Lightning cuando salga de CD si hay más de un enemigo; si no, Lightning Bolt de rango máximo de relleno (Lightning Overload puede lanzar uno extra gratis).","en":"Chain Lightning off cooldown when there is more than one enemy; otherwise top-rank Lightning Bolt as filler (Lightning Overload may cast an extra one for free)."},{"es":"Contra grupos: Chain Lightning, Fire Nova y Magma Totem.","en":"Against packs: Chain Lightning, Fire Nova and Magma Totem."},{"es":"Con el maná por debajo de la mitad, Mana Tide Totem si lo tenés; si no, bajá de rango o descansá entre grupos.","en":"Below half mana, Mana Tide Totem if you have it; otherwise drop a rank or rest between pulls."}],"level60Confidence":"client-data","source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman/elemental"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Consumibles: Minor Arcane Elixir (+5 de daño de hechizos) y Lesser Spellblasting Potion (+11).","en":"Consumables: Minor Arcane Elixir (+5 spell damage) and Lesser Spellblasting Potion (+11)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"note":{"es":"Encantamientos: Minor Wizard Oil (+8 de daño y curación) y Enchant Bracer - Minor Intellect (+3 Intelecto).","en":"Enchants: Minor Wizard Oil (+8 damage and healing) and Enchant Bracer - Minor Intellect (+3 Intellect)."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"keyTalents":[{"es":"Call of Thunder (fila 5, nivel 30) — +5% de crítico a Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning","en":"Call of Thunder (row 5, level 30) — +5% crit to Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning"},{"es":"Lightning Overload — 30% de chance de un Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning extra gratis, a la mitad de daño","en":"Lightning Overload — 30% chance for a free extra Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning at half damage"},{"es":"Lightning Mastery (fila 7, nivel 40) — 15 s de Lightning Bolt 0,5 s más rápido y Chain Lightning sin CD","en":"Lightning Mastery (row 7, level 40) — 15 sec of Lightning Bolt 0.5 sec faster and Chain Lightning without cooldown"},{"es":"Elemental Alacrity — −0,5 s a Lightning Bolt y Chain Lightning, ya en la fila 2","en":"Elemental Alacrity — −0.5 sec on Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning, already on row 2"},{"es":"Elemental Fury — tus críticos de hechizo hacen 100% más de daño (5 puntos, fila 6)","en":"Elemental Fury — your spell crits deal 100% more damage (5 points, row 6)"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"Al 30, Call of Thunder (como Icy Veins y WoWSims); la variante \"control\" cambia ese punto por Earthbound, para tener una inmovilización instantánea al subir de nivel solo. Del 30 al 60 seguimos la guía de leveo de Icy Veins: Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury, Lightning Mastery al 40 y después Tidal Focus (golpe) y Mindfulness en Restoration. Bajar a Restoration por Mana Tide Totem (fila 4, 15 puntos) rinde en peleas largas: WoWSims lo tiene como alternativa al 60.","en":"At 30, Call of Thunder (as Icy Veins and WoWSims do); the \"control\" variant swaps that point for Earthbound, for an instant root while leveling solo. From 30 to 60 we follow Icy Veins' leveling guide: Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury, Lightning Mastery at 40, then Tidal Focus (hit) and Mindfulness in Restoration. Dipping into Restoration for Mana Tide Totem (row 4, 15 points) pays off in long fights: WoWSims lists it as a level-60 alternative."}},"sources":["https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/9","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/elemental-shaman-pve-dps-stat-priority","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/elemental/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://github.com/wowsims/forever/tree/master/ui/specs/shaman"],"caveat":{"es":"WoW: Forever en vivo (lanzamiento 4-nov-2026, tope 60), con las notas del 2-nov y los hotfixes hasta el 9-nov. El orden de stats y la rotación siguen a WoWSims para Forever (pesos y lista de prioridades al 60), ajustados para levear: lo mismo con lo que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. La simulación es de una pelea contra un jefe: leveando, adaptala al bicho que tengas enfrente.","en":"WoW: Forever live (launched Nov 4, 2026, level cap 60), with the notes of Nov 2 and the hotfixes up to Nov 9. The stat order and the rotation follow WoWSims for Forever (weights and priority list at 60), adjusted for leveling: what Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. The sim is a boss fight: leveling, adapt it to whatever you're fighting."},"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: un staff, o un arma de una mano con escudo u off-hand. Enchanting craftea staves BoP para casters (Glimmering Staff al 25, Radiant Staff al 45, con Intelecto).","en":"Weapon: a staff, or a one-hander with a shield or off-hand. Enchanting crafts BoP caster staves (Glimmering Staff at 25, Radiant Staff at 45, with Intellect)."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Restoration":{"spec":"Restoration","role":{"es":"Healer","en":"Healer"},"summary":{"es":"Sostenés al grupo con Chain Heal, Riptide y totems, y sos el spec de Shaman al que menos tocó el recorte de Forever. Las curas casi no bajaron frente a Classic (Healing Wave −7%), mientras el daño de los hechizos cayó fuerte. Riptide (fila 7, nivel 40) es una cura en el tiempo (15 s, sin cura de entrada, 12 s de CD) que deja tu próximo Chain Heal sobre ese objetivo 25% más fuerte, y Mana Tide Totem está en la fila 4.","en":"You keep the group up with Chain Heal, Riptide and totems, and you're the Shaman spec Forever's cut touched least. Heals barely dropped compared to Classic (Healing Wave −7%), while spell damage fell hard. Riptide (row 7, level 40) is a heal over time (15 sec, no upfront heal, 12 sec cooldown) that makes your next Chain Heal on that target 25% stronger, and Mana Tide Totem sits on row 4."},"mechanicalChanges":[{"change":{"es":"Riptide es el nuevo final del árbol","en":"Riptide is the new bottom of the tree"},"detail":{"es":"Desde las notas del 2-nov (en el juego desde el 3-nov) Riptide ya no cura de entrada: cura 445 (rango 1) a lo largo de 15 s, con 12 s de CD (era 6 s) y un 40% menos de maná, y tu próximo Chain Heal directo sobre ese objetivo cura 25% más. Deja de ser la cura de emergencia: ponelo antes del golpe, en quien lo va a recibir. Rangos 2 y 3 a los 50 y 60.","en":"Since the notes of Nov 2 (in game since Nov 3) Riptide no longer heals upfront: it heals 445 (rank 1) over 15 sec, on a 12 sec cooldown (was 6 sec) and for 40% less mana, and your next Chain Heal directly on that target heals 25% more. It is no longer the emergency heal: put it on before the hit, on whoever is about to take it. Ranks 2 and 3 at 50 and 60."},"confidence":"official","source":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/9"},{"change":{"es":"Water Shield es un talento (fila 3)","en":"Water Shield is a talent (row 3)"},"detail":{"es":"3 globos: cuando te pegan o una cura tuya es crítica, recuperás 2% de tu maná máximo (un globo cada pocos segundos). Dura 10 min. Desde la build 70291 no tiene tiempo de reutilización. Solo un escudo elemental a la vez; ningún entrenador lo vende.","en":"3 globes: when you're hit or one of your heals crits, you regain 2% of your maximum mana (one globe every few seconds). Lasts 10 min. Since build 70291 it has no cooldown. Only one elemental shield at a time; no trainer sells it."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Mindfulness y Healing Way","en":"Mindfulness and Healing Way"},"detail":{"es":"Mindfulness (nuevo, fila 2): a 3/3, 50% de tu regeneración de maná sigue mientras lanzás hechizos; en Classic el Shaman no tenía nada así. Healing Way ahora da +25% plano a Healing Wave desde la primera (antes acumulaba 6% hasta 3 veces).","en":"Mindfulness (new, row 2): at 3/3, 50% of your mana regeneration continues while casting; Classic Shamans had nothing like it. Healing Way now gives a flat +25% to Healing Wave from the first one (it used to stack 6% up to 3 times)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"Mana Tide Totem sube a la fila 4 (nivel 25)","en":"Mana Tide Totem moves up to row 4 (level 25)"},"detail":{"es":"Antes estaba al final del árbol (nivel 40). Llega a 30 m; el rango 1 da 88 de maná cada 3 s (antes 170) y el rango 3 sigue en 290.","en":"It used to be at the bottom of the tree (level 40). Reaches 30 yards; rank 1 gives 88 mana every 3 sec (was 170) and rank 3 stays at 290."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},{"change":{"es":"El índice de golpe sale de Tidal Focus","en":"Hit comes from Tidal Focus"},"detail":{"es":"Nature's Guidance ya no existe: el único índice de golpe del árbol es Tidal Focus (5% a 5/5, fila 1 desde el build 70450). Tidal Mastery ya no da crítico a Lightning Bolt ni a Chain Lightning. Healing Focus llega al mismo 70% en 3 rangos (antes 5).","en":"Nature's Guidance is gone: the only hit in the tree is Tidal Focus (5% at 5/5, row 1 since build 70450). Tidal Mastery no longer adds crit to Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning. Healing Focus reaches the same 70% in 3 ranks (was 5)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"}],"statPriority":{"list":["Healing Power","Mana Regeneration (MP5)","Intellect","Spirit","Critical Strike"],"confidence":"classic-assumed","rationale":{"es":"Este orden es el mismo con el que Equipo › Tu camino elige tus piezas. WoWSims todavía no tiene pesos para Restauración en Forever: son los habituales de Classic. El poder de curación mejora cada cura; la regeneración (MP5) y el Intelecto sostienen el maná, y Mindfulness hace que el Espíritu rinda mientras lanzás. Tené suficiente Aguante para que un golpe suelto no te interrumpa una cura.","en":"This is the order Equipo › Your path picks your pieces with. WoWSims has no Restoration weights for Forever yet: these are Classic's usual ones. Healing power improves every heal; regeneration (MP5) and Intellect sustain your mana, and Mindfulness makes Spirit pay off while casting. Keep enough Stamina that a stray hit doesn't interrupt a heal."},"source":"https://github.com/wowsims/forever","forever":{"note":{"es":"Específico de Forever: las curas bajaron poco (Healing Wave −7%, Chain Heal −17%) y los rangos bajos de Healing Wave escalan más con poder con hechizos que en Classic. Con Mindfulness 3/3 y Water Shield, la regeneración vale más que en Classic.","en":"Forever-specific: heals barely dropped (Healing Wave −7%, Chain Heal −17%) and low Healing Wave ranks scale more with spell power than in Classic. With Mindfulness 3/3 and Water Shield, regeneration is worth more than in Classic."},"confidence":"client-data"}},"rotation":{"priority":[{"es":"Water Shield mientras curás, y un Mana Spring Totem útil desde el nivel 26.","en":"Water Shield while healing, and a useful Mana Spring Totem from level 26."},{"es":"Healing Wave cuando hay tiempo para el lanzamiento largo; Lesser Healing Wave si esperar ese lanzamiento pone en riesgo al objetivo.","en":"Healing Wave when there's time for the long cast; Lesser Healing Wave if waiting for that cast puts the target at risk."},{"es":"Healing Stream para daño de grupo constante; Tremor o un totem de limpieza cuando los efectos del enemigo lo justifiquen.","en":"Healing Stream for steady group damage; Tremor or a cleansing totem when the enemy's effects call for it."},{"es":"Desde el 25, Mana Tide donde el grupo pueda quedarse en rango. Al 30, guardá Nature's Swiftness para una cura urgente o para curar en movimiento.","en":"From 25, Mana Tide where the group can stay in range. At 30, save Nature's Swiftness for an urgent heal or for healing on the move."},{"es":"Al 40, Riptide al tanque antes del pull y cada 12 s; Chain Heal directo sobre él (25% más). Para emergencias, Nature's Swiftness + Healing Wave: Riptide ya no cura de golpe.","en":"At 40, Riptide on the tank before the pull and every 12 sec; Chain Heal directly on them (25% more). For emergencies, Nature's Swiftness + Healing Wave: Riptide no longer heals at once."}],"confidence":"classic-assumed","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/"},"gearingNotes":[{"note":{"es":"Los críticos de curación pueden consumir globos de Water Shield: revisalo en pulls largos y renovalo.","en":"Healing crits can consume Water Shield globes: check it during long pulls and refresh it."},"confidence":"classic-assumed"},{"note":{"es":"Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power: +8 de curación en muñecas, permanente.","en":"Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power: +8 healing on bracers, permanent."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"keyTalents":[{"es":"Riptide (fila 7) — cura en el tiempo de 15 s, y Chain Heal 25% más fuerte sobre ese objetivo","en":"Riptide (row 7) — 15 sec heal over time, and Chain Heal 25% stronger on that target"},{"es":"Nature's Swiftness — tu próximo hechizo de Naturaleza de menos de 10 s sale instantáneo","en":"Nature's Swiftness — your next Nature spell under 10 sec becomes instant"},{"es":"Water Shield — 2% de maná por globo al recibir golpes o con curas críticas","en":"Water Shield — 2% mana per globe when you're hit or your heals crit"},{"es":"Mana Tide Totem — maná para el grupo, ya en la fila 4","en":"Mana Tide Totem — mana for the group, now on row 4"},{"es":"Mindfulness — 50% de regeneración de maná mientras lanzás hechizos, a 3/3","en":"Mindfulness — 50% mana regen while casting at 3/3"}],"recommendedBuild":{"note":{"es":"El build 'Healer de mazmorras' sigue la mejor estimación de la comunidad, que aclara explícitamente que no se probó en juego. A 60 recomendamos 0/10/41, el build de Resto más armado en talentsforever.com: es justo donde termina el leveo 10→60.","en":"The 'Dungeon healer' build follows the community's best guess, which explicitly says it hasn't been tested in game. At 60 we recommend 0/10/41, the most built Resto build on talentsforever.com: it's exactly where the 10→60 leveling order ends."}},"sources":["https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/restoration-shaman-leveling","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/9","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/restoration-shaman-healer-pve-guide","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"],"caveat":{"es":"WoW: Forever en vivo (lanzamiento 4-nov-2026, tope 60), con las notas del 2-nov y los hotfixes hasta el 9-nov. Todo lo de esta guía lleva su nivel de confianza.","en":"WoW: Forever live (launched Nov 4, 2026, level cap 60), with the notes of Nov 2 and the hotfixes up to Nov 9. Everything in this guide carries its confidence level."},"gearTargets":[{"note":{"es":"Arma: un staff, o un arma de una mano con escudo u off-hand. Enchanting craftea staves BoP con Espíritu (Soulstaff al 25, Dreamstaff al 45) y el totem Polished Driftwood Icon (reliquia, 20).","en":"Weapon: a staff, or a one-hander with a shield or off-hand. Enchanting crafts BoP Spirit staves (Soulstaff at 25, Dreamstaff at 45) and the Polished Driftwood Icon totem (relic, 20)."},"confidence":"client-data"}]},"Overview":{"classNotes":[{"fact":{"es":"Tope de nivel 60 (51 puntos de talento) desde el lanzamiento del 4-nov. La beta llegaba al 30: lo de más arriba sale de los datos del cliente y de las guías (Icy Veins, WoWSims), y se va confirmando con lo que ven los jugadores.","en":"Level cap 60 (51 talent points) since the Nov 4 launch. The beta went up to 30: what is above comes from client data and guides (Icy Veins, WoWSims), and gets confirmed as players see it."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Progresión de armadura: Cuero hasta nivel 40, luego Malla (como en Classic; el entrenador la enseña al 40).","en":"Armor progression: Leather until level 40, then Mail (as in Classic; the trainer teaches it at 40)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Recurso: Mana (sin cambios vs Classic Era).","en":"Resource: Mana (unchanged from Classic Era)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Talentos: 50 (Classic tenía 46). 12 nuevos, 30 cambiados, 3 movidos y 5 iguales; 8 talentos de Classic ya no existen.","en":"Talents: 50 (Classic had 46). 12 new, 30 changed, 3 moved and 5 unchanged; 8 Classic talents are gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Spellbook: 10 hechizos nuevos, 9 rehechos y 22 con números nuevos respecto de Classic. Todo en el tab Spellbook.","en":"Spellbook: 10 new spells, 9 reworked and 22 with new numbers compared to Classic. All of it in the Spellbook tab."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Ningún árbol es de tanque, pero Enhancement tiene piezas: Spirit Weapons (parada y +30% de amenaza con Rockbiter activo), Anticipation (+6% de esquiva) y Toughness (+10% de Aguante). Shield Specialization ya no existe.","en":"No tree is a tank tree, but Enhancement has the pieces: Spirit Weapons (parry and +30% threat with Rockbiter active), Anticipation (+6% dodge) and Toughness (+10% Stamina). Shield Specialization is gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Dual wield: ningún hechizo, talento ni entrenador lo enseña en el cliente de Forever, y Blizzard pensó Enhancement para un arma a dos manos.","en":"Dual wield: no spell, talent or trainer teaches it in the Forever client, and Blizzard designed Enhancement around a two-handed weapon."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Hachas y mazas a dos manos ahora vienen de base (por eso desapareció el talento Two-Handed Axes and Maces).","en":"Two-handed axes and maces are now baseline (which is why the Two-Handed Axes and Maces talent is gone)."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Dual spec se desbloquea al nivel 40. El respec se hace en el entrenador de clase de una ciudad grande, e incluye los talentos de Legacy.","en":"Dual spec unlocks at level 40. Respecs happen at a major city's class trainer, and include the Legacy talents."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Entrenar todo del 1 al 60 cuesta unos 206 de oro (notas del 2-nov), y los hechizos nuevos ya no se ponen solos en tus barras.","en":"Training everything from 1 to 60 costs about 206 gold (notes of Nov 2), and new spells no longer go on your bars by themselves."},"confidence":"official"}],"races":{"note":{"es":"5 razas pueden ser Shaman. Dos son nuevas para la clase: Dwarf (la única opción Alliance) y Skyborne (Windshaper), una raza Horde nueva en WoW: Forever que se entrena con Shenthul en Orgrimmar. Raciales leídas del cliente del lanzamiento (cambiaron el 26 de octubre).","en":"5 races can be a Shaman. Two are new to the class: Dwarf (the only Alliance option) and Skyborne (Windshaper), a Horde race new in WoW: Forever that trains with Shenthul in Orgrimmar. Racials read from the launch client (changed on October 26)."},"confidence":"client-data","newToShaman":["Dwarf","Skyborne (Windshaper)"]},"sources":["https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes","https://talentsforever.com/launch","https://talentsforever.com/shaman/questions","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/","https://classicwowforever.com/sources/","https://talentsforever.com (CC BY 4.0) — data/shaman.json"],"caveat":{"es":"classicwowforever.com distingue explícitamente entre dato probado en juego, dato del cliente, comportamiento asumido de Classic Era, y reporte de comunidad sin confirmar. Todo lo de esta página está etiquetado con ese mismo criterio (campo confidence) — puede cambiar con cada parche.","en":"classicwowforever.com explicitly separates in-game tested facts, client data, behavior assumed from Classic Era, and unconfirmed community reports. Everything on this page is labeled with that same scheme (the confidence field) — it can change with any patch."},"timeline":[{"date":{"es":"17 sep 2026","en":"Sep 17, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Abre la beta.","en":"The beta opens."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"24 sep 2026","en":"Sep 24, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70009: 10 cambios a Shaman. Elemental Fury y Elemental Alacrity cambian de fila, Rage of the Farseer deja de afectar hechizos, y las notas dicen que Riptide puede ser crítico y que Windfury, Grace of Air y Tranquil Air ya no se apilan.","en":"Build 70009: 10 Shaman changes. Elemental Fury and Elemental Alacrity swap rows, Rage of the Farseer stops affecting spells, and the notes say Riptide can crit and that Windfury, Grace of Air and Tranquil Air no longer stack."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"1 oct 2026","en":"Oct 1, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70170: cap a nivel 30. Un cambio a Shaman: Disease Cleansing Totem pasa de 2 a 5 minutos.","en":"Build 70170: level 30 cap. One Shaman change: Disease Cleansing Totem goes from 2 to 5 minutes."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"8 oct 2026","en":"Oct 8, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70291: Water Shield pierde su reutilización de 15 s, Lightning Bolt rango 1 baja a 14–16, y Mana Tide Totem pasa a nivel 25 en los archivos.","en":"Build 70291: Water Shield loses its 15 sec cooldown, Lightning Bolt rank 1 drops to 14–16, and Mana Tide Totem moves to level 25 in the files."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"17 oct 2026","en":"Oct 17, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Build 70450: nuevo árbol Elemental. Se van Call of Thunder e Improved Fire Nova, llegan Trial by Fire y Elemental Mastery (talento final), Lava Burst sube a la fila 5; en Restoration, Tidal Focus y Totemic Focus cambian de fila. Fire Nova hace casi la mitad de daño y los totems de grupo pasan a afectar a la banda.","en":"Build 70450: new Elemental tree. Call of Thunder and Improved Fire Nova are gone, Trial by Fire and Elemental Mastery (final talent) arrive, Lava Burst moves up to row 5; in Restoration, Tidal Focus and Totemic Focus swap rows. Fire Nova deals about half the damage and party totems now affect the raid."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"date":{"es":"22 oct 2026","en":"Oct 22, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Termina la beta (antes, el 21, un stress test abierto a todos).","en":"The beta ends (on the 21st, a stress test open to everyone)."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"26 oct 2026","en":"Oct 26, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Blizzard rehace las raciales para el lanzamiento: Orc pierde Savage (1% de crítico) y recupera Command, Dwarf cambia Earth Fury por Artisan's Precision (1% de golpe), Tauren pierde el crítico de Endurance, Troll con Berserking de 15 s, Skyborne baja a 2% de celeridad.","en":"Blizzard redoes the racials for launch: Orc loses Savage (1% crit) and gets Command back, Dwarf swaps Earth Fury for Artisan's Precision (1% hit), Tauren loses Endurance's crit, Troll gets a 15 s Berserking, Skyborne drops to 2% haste."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"27 oct 2026","en":"Oct 27, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Se abren la reserva de nombres y la creación de personajes.","en":"Name reservation and character creation open."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"2–3 nov 2026","en":"Nov 2–3, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Notas de Blizzard para Shaman, en el juego por hotfix el 3-nov: sale Lava Burst y vuelve Call of Thunder, Elemental Mastery pasa a Lightning Mastery, Stormstrike 150% cada 6 s, Maelstrom Weapon el doble de seguido, Flurry 30%, Mental Dexterity 150%, Riptide solo cura en el tiempo, Totemic Projection pasa a Totemic Call, Improved Ghost Wolf a la fila 4; Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning y los shocks pegan más.","en":"Blizzard's Shaman notes, in game by hotfix on Nov 3: Lava Burst out and Call of Thunder back, Elemental Mastery becomes Lightning Mastery, Stormstrike 150% every 6 sec, Maelstrom Weapon twice as often, Flurry 30%, Mental Dexterity 150%, Riptide heals over time only, Totemic Projection becomes Totemic Call, Improved Ghost Wolf to row 4; Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning and the shocks hit harder."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"4 nov 2026","en":"Nov 4, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Lanzamiento global de WoW: Forever, 15:00 PST (23:00 UTC).","en":"Global launch of WoW: Forever, 3:00 p.m. PST (23:00 UTC)."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"6 nov 2026","en":"Nov 6, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Hotfix: en Teldrassil los bichos dejan de ser inmunes a Naturaleza, los drops de misión de Riverglades se comparten en grupo, la Tanning Rack pide Leatherworking 125. Blizzard anuncia cambios a Enhancement para el 10-nov: la Fuerza va a ser su mejor stat.","en":"Hotfix: Teldrassil mobs are no longer immune to Nature, Riverglades quest drops are shared in a group, the Tanning Rack needs Leatherworking 125. Blizzard announces Enhancement changes for Nov 10: Strength will be its best stat."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"8–9 nov 2026","en":"Nov 8–9, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Matar bichos en dungeons da 50% más de XP. Hotfix del 9: Lightning Overload hace el daño correcto con Lightning Bolt; Zarla Ober (Alcaz Prison) y Vitrix, Snowtalon y Cinder (Shaper's Terrace) ya tiran loot; The Drowned City pega 30% menos.","en":"Killing dungeon mobs gives 50% more XP. Nov 9 hotfix: Lightning Overload deals the right damage with Lightning Bolt; Zarla Ober (Alcaz Prison) and Vitrix, Snowtalon and Cinder (Shaper's Terrace) now drop loot; The Drowned City hits 30% less."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"10 nov 2026","en":"Nov 10, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Cambios de clase anunciados: Enhancement (la Fuerza pasa a ser su mejor stat), mascotas de Cazador y Voidwalker, Affliction.","en":"Announced class changes: Enhancement (Strength becomes its best stat), Hunter pets and Voidwalkers, Affliction."},"confidence":"official"},{"date":{"es":"9 dic 2026","en":"Dec 9, 2026"},"event":{"es":"Abren las primeras raids: Barrow Deeps (10), Hyjal Summit (20) y Onyxia's Lair (40).","en":"The first raids open: Barrow Deeps (10), Hyjal Summit (20) and Onyxia's Lair (40)."},"confidence":"official"}],"totems":{"notes":[{"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de los totems dura 5 minutos (antes 2; Healing Stream y Mana Spring, 1) y los de grupo llegan a 30 m, que es lo que daba Totemic Mastery (ese talento ya no existe).","en":"Most totems last 5 minutes (was 2; Healing Stream and Mana Spring, 1) and party totems reach 30 yards, which is what Totemic Mastery used to give (that talent is gone)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Mantienen su duración de Classic: Earthbind, Grounding, Stoneclaw, Searing, Magma, Mana Tide y Sentry.","en":"These keep their Classic duration: Earthbind, Grounding, Stoneclaw, Searing, Magma, Mana Tide and Sentry."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Siguen haciendo falta los cuatro ítems de totem: cada totem pide el de su elemento (Tools: Earth/Fire/Water/Air Totem).","en":"You still need the four totem items: each totem asks for its element's (Tools: Earth/Fire/Water/Air Totem)."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Call of the Elements (nivel 20, 3 s de lanzamiento) baja hasta 4 totems de tu barra de totems de una. Call of the Ancestors (30) y Call of the Spirits (40) son un 2º y 3er set guardado.","en":"Call of the Elements (level 20, 3 sec cast) drops up to 4 totems from your Totem Bar at once. Call of the Ancestors (30) and Call of the Spirits (40) are a 2nd and 3rd saved set."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Totemic Recall (20) levanta tus totems y te devuelve 25% del maná de cada uno. Totemic Call (22) los trae a donde estás vos, cada 30 s.","en":"Totemic Recall (20) picks your totems back up and returns 25% of each one's mana. Totemic Call (22) brings them to where you are, every 30 sec."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Fire Nova ahora es un hechizo (nivel 12, instantáneo, 10 s de CD) que explota alrededor de tu totem de fuego. Fire Nova Totem ya no existe.","en":"Fire Nova is now a spell (level 12, instant, 10 sec cooldown) that blasts around your Fire totem. Fire Nova Totem is gone."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Windfury, Grace of Air y Tranquil Air ya no se apilan entre sí, ni siquiera de dos Shamans distintos. Flametongue Totem no se apila con Flametongue Weapon ni con Windfury Totem.","en":"Windfury, Grace of Air and Tranquil Air no longer stack with each other, not even from two different Shamans. Flametongue Totem doesn't stack with Flametongue Weapon or Windfury Totem."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Los imbues de arma duran 60 minutos (eran 5). Windfury o Flametongue Weapon en la mano principal anulan, solo para vos, el totem del mismo nombre.","en":"Weapon imbues last 60 minutes (was 5). Windfury or Flametongue Weapon on your main hand cancels, for you only, the totem of the same name."},"confidence":"client-data"}],"changed":[{"totem":"Strength of Earth Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 5","en":"Rank 5"},"classic":{"es":"+77 Fuerza","en":"+77 Strength"},"forever":{"es":"+53 Fuerza","en":"+53 Strength"},"pct":-31},{"totem":"Grace of Air Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 3","en":"Rank 3"},"classic":{"es":"+77 Agilidad","en":"+77 Agility"},"forever":{"es":"+89 Agilidad","en":"+89 Agility"},"pct":16},{"totem":"Windfury Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 3","en":"Rank 3"},"classic":{"es":"+315 AP, cualquier golpe","en":"+315 AP, any hit"},"forever":{"es":"+246 AP, solo mano principal","en":"+246 AP, main hand only"},"pct":-22},{"totem":"Flametongue Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 4","en":"Rank 4"},"classic":{"es":"15,8–48,7 de fuego","en":"15.8–48.7 Fire"},"forever":{"es":"17–55 de fuego","en":"17–55 Fire"},"pct":12},{"totem":"Healing Stream Totem","rank":{"es":"Rango 5","en":"Rank 5"},"classic":{"es":"14 cada 2 s","en":"14 every 2 sec"},"forever":{"es":"11 cada 2 s","en":"11 every 2 sec"},"pct":-21}],"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"},"damage":{"spells":[["Lightning Bolt","Rank 10"],["Chain Lightning","Rank 4"],["Earth Shock","Rank 7"],["Frost Shock","Rank 4"],["Healing Wave","Rank 10"],["Lesser Healing Wave","Rank 6"],["Chain Heal","Rank 3"]],"notes":[{"fact":{"es":"Por qué: Blizzard puso poder con hechizos en el equipo desde el nivel 10, empezando por las armas, y bajó el daño base de los hechizos en lo que suelen dar los verdes de quest (WoW: Forever Podcast, ep. 2).","en":"Why: Blizzard put spell power on gear from level 10, starting with weapons, and lowered spells' base damage by what typical questing greens give (WoW: Forever Podcast, ep. 2)."},"confidence":"official"},{"fact":{"es":"Lightning Bolt (rangos 4–10) pasó de 85,7% a 71,4% de coeficiente y Chain Lightning de 71,4% a ~57%. En cambio los rangos bajos ganaron coeficiente: Lightning Bolt 1–3, Healing Wave 1–4 y Earth Shock 1–3 escalan más con poder con hechizos que en Classic.","en":"Lightning Bolt (ranks 4–10) went from an 85.7% to a 71.4% coefficient and Chain Lightning from 71.4% to ~57%. Low ranks, on the other hand, gained coefficient: Lightning Bolt 1–3, Healing Wave 1–4 and Earth Shock 1–3 scale more with spell power than in Classic."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Las curas casi no bajaron (Healing Wave −7%), así que Restoration es el spec menos afectado por el cambio.","en":"Heals barely dropped (Healing Wave −7%), so Restoration is the spec least affected by the change."},"confidence":"client-data"},{"fact":{"es":"Si algo más (gear, talentos, buffs) compensa la diferencia en juego, todavía nadie lo midió.","en":"Whether anything else (gear, talents, buffs) makes up the difference in play, nobody has measured yet."},"confidence":"community-untested"}],"source":"https://talentsforever.com/shaman/changes"}},"Professions":{"spec":"Professions","intro":{"es":"En Forever las profesiones son mucho más que en Classic: hay más de 800 recetas nuevas, y Leatherworking, Tailoring y Blacksmithing tienen sets raros que se ligan al recogerlos (BoP) en casi todos los rangos de nivel. Para un Shaman, eso las vuelve parte de la progresión de equipo mientras subís de nivel, no solo una forma de hacer oro.","en":"In Forever, professions are much more than in Classic: there are over 800 new recipes, and Leatherworking, Tailoring and Blacksmithing have rare bind-on-pickup (BoP) sets in nearly every level bracket. For a Shaman that makes them part of your gear progression while leveling, not just a way to make gold."},"pairs":[{"specs":["Enhancement"],"pair":"Leatherworking + Skinning","when":{"es":"Recomendado, del 1 al 60","en":"Recommended, 1 to 60"},"why":{"es":"Es la única profesión que te viste todo el leveo. Hasta el 40 hace sets raros BoP de cuero con Fuerza y Agilidad: Brawler's y Defender's (12–25), Warden's, Skulker's y Prowler's (30–50), con patrones por 30 a 90 de Merchant's Favor. Desde el 40, cuando el Shaman pasa a malla, Leatherworking también la fabrica: el cliente tiene 115 piezas de malla raras o mejores de Leatherworking entre el 40 y el 60 (Dragonscale, Skirmisher's y otras), así que no hace falta pasarse a Blacksmithing. Skinning abastece el cuero y su objeto de campamento, Camp Chair, da +2% de crítico al grupo. The Forever Era cuenta 5 piezas de Leatherworking en el mejor equipo de Enhancement al 20 y 6 al 30.","en":"It's the one profession that gears you through all of leveling. Up to 40 it makes rare BoP leather sets with Strength and Agility: Brawler's and Defender's (12–25), Warden's, Skulker's and Prowler's (30–50), with patterns for 30 to 90 Merchant's Favor. From 40, when Shamans move to mail, Leatherworking makes that too: the client has 115 rare or better Leatherworking mail pieces between 40 and 60 (Dragonscale, Skirmisher's and more), so there's no need to switch to Blacksmithing. Skinning supplies the leather and its camp object, Camp Chair, gives the group +2% crit. The Forever Era counts 5 Leatherworking pieces in Enhancement's best level-20 gear and 6 at 30."},"tldr":{"es":"La mejor opción: te viste en cuero hasta el 40 y en malla del 40 al 60, sin cambiar de profesión.","en":"The best pick: leather gear up to 40 and mail from 40 to 60, without switching professions."}},{"specs":["Enhancement"],"pair":"Blacksmithing + Mining","when":{"es":"Solo si querés fabricar tus armas","en":"Only to make your own weapons"},"why":{"es":"Blacksmithing hace hachas y mazas a dos manos con Fuerza + poder con hechizos, pero la mayoría se liga al equiparse (BoE) y se compra en la Casa de Subastas: Charged Mithril Battleaxe (43), Stormcarver (58, planos con Timbermaw Hold en Revered) y Forest Defender's Axe (60, épica). Solo Thorium Greatmace (50, planos por 90 de Favor) es BoP. Sus sets de malla BoP están casi todos entre el 10 y el 39, cuando el Shaman todavía usa cuero, así que mientras subís te da poco. Mining aporta Lodestone al campamento (+12 a +90 de poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo). Las profesiones no se cambian a mitad de camino: si la elegís, que sea desde el principio.","en":"Blacksmithing makes two-handed axes and maces with Strength + spell power, but most bind on equip (BoE) and can be bought on the Auction House: Charged Mithril Battleaxe (43), Stormcarver (58, plans from Timbermaw Hold at Revered) and Forest Defender's Axe (60, epic). Only Thorium Greatmace (50, plans for 90 Favor) is BoP. Its BoP mail sets sit almost all between 10 and 39, while Shamans still wear leather, so it gives little while leveling. Mining adds Lodestone to camp (+12 to +90 melee attack power). You don't switch professions halfway: if you pick it, pick it from the start."},"tldr":{"es":"No muy recomendable para Shaman: sus sets de malla llegan antes de que puedas usar malla, y casi todas sus armas se pueden comprar. Solo si querés fabricarte el arma.","en":"Not very recommended for Shaman: its mail sets come before you can wear mail, and most of its weapons can be bought. Only if you want to make your own weapon."}},{"specs":["Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Leatherworking + Skinning","when":{"es":"Recomendado, del 1 al 60","en":"Recommended, 1 to 60"},"why":{"es":"Los sets de caster de Leatherworking cubren todo el leveo: Stormrider's, Totemic, Trapper's y Wisdom's (12–25), y Skycaller's y Mender's (30–50). Desde el 40 también hace malla: de las 115 piezas de malla raras o mejores que tiene entre el 40 y el 60, 59 llevan stats de caster o híbridas (Mender's, Skycaller's, Glowing Hyperconductive Scale). Casi todas son BoP, con patrones por Merchant's Favor. classicwowforever la marca como la mejor combinación para Shaman. The Forever Era la pone primera para Shaman: Leatherworking es la profesión con más piezas en el mejor equipo del Shaman (37), y Overgear la recomienda para Restoration.","en":"Leatherworking's caster sets cover all of leveling: Stormrider's, Totemic, Trapper's and Wisdom's (12–25), then Skycaller's and Mender's (30–50). From 40 it makes mail too: of its 115 rare or better mail pieces between 40 and 60, 59 carry caster or hybrid stats (Mender's, Skycaller's, Glowing Hyperconductive Scale). Nearly all are BoP, with patterns for Merchant's Favor. classicwowforever rates it the best pair for Shaman. The Forever Era lists it first for Shaman: Leatherworking has the most pieces in Shaman best-in-slot gear (37), and Overgear recommends it for Restoration."},"tldr":{"es":"La más recomendada también para casters: sets de cuero con Intelecto y poder con hechizos hasta el 40, y malla de caster del 40 al 60.","en":"The most recommended for casters too: leather sets with Intellect and spell power up to 40, and caster mail from 40 to 60."}},{"specs":["Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Enchanting + Tailoring","when":{"es":"Alternativa sin recolectar","en":"Alternative with no gathering"},"why":{"es":"Enchanting craftea las mejores armas de caster tempranas, y son BoP, así que solo las usa el que las hace: Glimmering Staff (25, Intelecto y +34 de poder con hechizos), Soulstaff (25, Espíritu), Radiant Staff (45, +56) y Dreamstaff (45). Las fórmulas cuestan 45 de Favor. También hace los totems de reliquia (Polished Driftwood Icon al 20), Enchant Bracer – Minor Healing Power (Enchanting 90) y Minor Mana Oil (150, nivel 20: maná cada 5 s y +10 de curación), que classicwowforever recomienda para Restoration. lfcarry propone Alchemy + Enchanting para Restoration. Ninguna de las dos necesita recolectar, y se pueden subir comprando materiales. Tailoring tiene sets de tela BoP de caster en cada rango, pero ninguna guía la recomienda para Shaman: es tela y perdés armadura frente al cuero o la malla.","en":"Enchanting crafts the best early caster weapons, and they're BoP, so only the maker uses them: Glimmering Staff (25, Intellect and +34 spell power), Soulstaff (25, Spirit), Radiant Staff (45, +56) and Dreamstaff (45). Formulas cost 45 Favor. It also makes relic totems (Polished Driftwood Icon at 20), Enchant Bracer – Minor Healing Power (Enchanting 90) and Minor Mana Oil (150, level 20: mana every 5 sec and +10 healing), which classicwowforever recommends for Restoration. lfcarry suggests Alchemy + Enchanting for Restoration. Neither needs gathering, and both can be leveled by buying materials. Tailoring has BoP caster cloth sets in every bracket, but no guide recommends it for Shaman: it's cloth and you give up armor compared to leather or mail."},"tldr":{"es":"Por Enchanting, no por Tailoring: hace staves de caster BoP muy fuertes y encantamientos de curación. Tailoring es tela y el Shaman pierde armadura; sirve para alimentar Enchanting.","en":"For Enchanting, not Tailoring: it makes very strong BoP caster staves and healing enchants. Tailoring is cloth and Shamans lose armor; it feeds Enchanting."}},{"specs":["Enhancement","Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Herbalism + Alchemy","when":{"es":"Alternativa: oro y consumibles","en":"Alternative: gold and consumables"},"why":{"es":"No hace equipo, pero es la combinación más barata para un primer personaje: no comprás materiales y vendés hierbas y pociones. Suma dos buffs de campamento: Mana Well (Alchemy, maná cada 5 s) e Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intelecto), útiles para los tres specs porque todos dependen del maná. Ojo: en Forever las pociones de curación pasaron a First Aid, y la racial de Tauren hace que juntar hierbas de zonas altas sea posible desde muy bajo nivel. Si la elegís, el equipo sale de quests y dungeons, y los crafteos que se pueden comerciar, de la Casa de Subastas. classicwowforever la elige para raids (frascos, elixires y pociones al 60), y para Restoration suma Minor Cleric's Elixir (nivel 5, +10 de curación), Lesser Mender's Potion (15) y Elixir of Wisdom (10, +6 de Intelecto).","en":"It makes no gear, but it's the cheapest pair for a first character: you buy no materials and sell herbs and potions. It adds two camp buffs: Mana Well (Alchemy, mana every 5 sec) and Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intellect), useful for all three specs since all of them run on mana. Note: in Forever healing potions moved to First Aid, and the Tauren racial lets you gather high-zone herbs from very low level. If you pick it, your gear comes from quests and dungeons, and tradeable crafts from the Auction House. classicwowforever picks it for raiding (flasks, elixirs and potions at 60), and for Restoration adds Minor Cleric's Elixir (level 5, +10 healing), Lesser Mender's Potion (15) and Elixir of Wisdom (10, +6 Intellect)."},"tldr":{"es":"Oro y consumibles, sin equipo. classicwowforever la recomienda para raids al 60.","en":"Gold and consumables, no gear. classicwowforever recommends it for raiding at 60."}},{"specs":["Enhancement","Elemental","Restoration"],"pair":"Engineering + Mining","when":{"es":"Utilidad y PvP","en":"Utility and PvP"},"why":{"es":"Engineering hace poco equipo para Shaman: unos 50 ítems usables y solo 5 raros BoP. Su valor está en la utilidad (bombas, dispositivos, Repair Bot) y en PvP. Mining suma Lodestone al campamento. Es una elección por estilo de juego, no por progresión de equipo.","en":"Engineering makes little Shaman gear: about 50 usable items and only 5 rare BoP ones. Its value is utility (bombs, devices, Repair Bot) and PvP. Mining adds Lodestone to camp. It's a playstyle pick, not a gear-progression one."},"tldr":{"es":"Por diversión y PvP, no por equipo.","en":"For fun and PvP, not for gear."}}],"pairsNote":{"es":"Recomendaciones del sitio, armadas con lo que cada profesión craftea según el cliente del juego, los buffs de campamento y lo que comentan los jugadores en el foro oficial de la beta (la estrategia que se impone es tomar la profesión que craftea tu tipo de armadura). En Equipo podés marcar tus profesiones para ver solo las armas que podés conseguir. Ninguna recomendación está probada en juego a nivel alto: la beta llegaba solo al 30.","en":"Site recommendations, built from what each profession crafts according to the game client, the camp buffs, and what players say on the official beta forum (the emerging strategy is to take the profession that crafts your armor type). On the Gear page you can mark your professions to see only weapons you can get. None are tested in game at high level: the beta only went up to 30."},"systems":[{"title":{"es":"Rangos y niveles","en":"Ranks and levels"},"fact":{"es":"Apprentice desde nivel 5 (tope 75), Journeyman desde nivel 10 y skill 50 (tope 150), Expert desde nivel 20 y skill 125 (tope 225), Artisan desde nivel 35 y skill 200 (tope 300). Cada zona inicial tiene un objeto de quest que enseña una profesión de recolección.","en":"Apprentice from level 5 (cap 75), Journeyman from level 10 and skill 50 (cap 150), Expert from level 20 and skill 125 (cap 225), Artisan from level 35 and skill 200 (cap 300). Each starting zone has a quest item that teaches a gathering profession."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview"},{"title":{"es":"Merchant's Favor","en":"Merchant's Favor"},"fact":{"es":"Moneda nueva, por personaje. Se gana llenando Waylaid Crates (cajas que caen en el mundo o se compran en la subasta): 5 a 30 de Favor por caja según rango, desde el nivel 10. Los Craftsman's Writs dan reputación, no Favor. Con Favor se compran patrones (30 sin reputación, 60 en Friendly, 90 a 120 en Honored, más para Engineering y Enchanting). Vendedores: Azeroth Commerce Authority en Three Corners (Redridge, Alianza) y Durotar Supply and Logistics al oeste de Crossroads (Barrens, Horda); venden lo mismo.","en":"New per-character currency. Earned by filling Waylaid Crates (world drops or bought on the Auction House): 5 to 30 Favor per crate by rank, from level 10. Craftsman's Writs give reputation, not Favor. Favor buys patterns (30 with no reputation, 60 at Friendly, 90 to 120 at Honored, more for Engineering and Enchanting). Vendors: Azeroth Commerce Authority at Three Corners (Redridge, Alliance) and Durotar Supply and Logistics west of Crossroads (Barrens, Horde); same stock."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever/merchants-favor-durotar-supply-azeroth-commerce"},{"title":{"es":"Campamento","en":"Camping"},"fact":{"es":"Cooking arma la fogata (Basic: 3 objetos; Journeyman: 5; Expert: 10) y cada profesión aporta un objeto con un buff de 1 hora para quien descansa cerca, aunque no tenga esa profesión. Los objetos comparten 1 hora de reutilización. Para Shaman sirven sobre todo: Camp Chair (Skinning, +2% de crítico), Lodestone (Mining, poder de ataque), Mana Well (Alchemy, maná), Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intelecto), Fish Bowl (Fishing, +8% a todos los atributos). Sharpening Wheel (Blacksmithing, Fuerza) se pisa con Strength of Earth Totem.","en":"Cooking builds the fire (Basic: 3 objects; Journeyman: 5; Expert: 10) and each profession adds an object with a 1-hour buff for anyone resting nearby, even without that profession. Objects share a 1-hour cooldown. Most useful for Shaman: Camp Chair (Skinning, +2% crit), Lodestone (Mining, attack power), Mana Well (Alchemy, mana), Incense Candle (Herbalism, Intellect), Fish Bowl (Fishing, +8% all attributes). Sharpening Wheel (Blacksmithing, Strength) overlaps with Strength of Earth Totem."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/camping/"},{"title":{"es":"Puntos de Legacy","en":"Legacy points"},"fact":{"es":"Cada profesión de crafteo (Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, Tailoring) da 1 punto de Legacy a toda la cuenta a 150, 225 y 300 de skill: hasta 18 puntos. Subir profesiones distintas en distintos personajes suma para todos. Hay perks de profesión como Working Overtime (+4% de chance de subir skill por rango) o Bountiful Harvest (más materiales escasos al recolectar).","en":"Each crafting profession (Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, Tailoring) gives the whole account 1 Legacy point at 150, 225 and 300 skill: up to 18 points. Leveling different professions on different characters adds up for all. There are profession perks such as Working Overtime (+4% skill-up chance per rank) or Bountiful Harvest (more scarce materials when gathering)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/legacy-perks/"},{"title":{"es":"Patrones por personaje","en":"Patterns per character"},"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de los patrones nuevos se ligan al recogerlos y el Favor es por personaje: cada personaje compra los suyos. Los sets BoP solo los usa quien los craftea.","en":"Most new patterns bind on pickup and Favor is per character: each character buys its own. BoP sets can only be used by whoever crafts them."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever/merchants-favor-durotar-supply-azeroth-commerce"}],"leveling":[{"site":"wow-professions.com","url":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever","note":{"es":"Guías 1–300 por profesión, la ruta más barata y dónde están los entrenadores. Probadas hasta el 30 en la beta; lo de más arriba, de las guías y los datos del juego.","en":"1–300 guides per profession, the cheapest route and trainer locations. Tested up to 30 in the beta; above that, from the guides and game data."}},{"site":"classicwowforever.com","url":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/","note":{"es":"Guías de leveo paso a paso y la lista completa de recetas con cómo se aprende cada una.","en":"Step-by-step leveling guides and the full recipe list with how each one is learned."}},{"site":"endgametools.com","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/leveling","note":{"es":"Planificador 1–300 con cantidad de pasos y de crafteos por profesión.","en":"1–300 planner with step and craft counts per profession."}}],"sources":["https://classicwowforever.com/professions/","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/best/shaman/","https://www.wow-professions.com/forever","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/classes/shaman/","https://wago.tools","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/feedback-professions/2356010 — foro oficial de la beta / official beta forum","https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/choose-professions/ — piezas de cada profesión en el mejor equipo / pieces per profession in best gear","https://lfcarry.com/guides/wow-forever-restoration-shaman-pve — Restoration: Alchemy + Enchanting","https://classicwowforever.com/class-guides/shaman/restoration/ — encantamientos y consumibles de Restoration / Restoration enchants and consumables","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/ — cocina / cooking","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/ — pesca / fishing","https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/ — primeros auxilios / first aid"],"caveat":{"es":"Recetas, costos de Favor y fuentes de patrones pueden cambiar con cada parche. Las listas de crafteos salen del cliente; cómo se aprende cada receta, de classicwowforever.com (que cita Wowhead Forever y el datamine de Daybreak Forever).","en":"Recipes, Favor costs and pattern sources may change with any patch. The crafted item lists come from the client; how each recipe is learned comes from classicwowforever.com (which cites Wowhead Forever and the Daybreak Forever datamine)."},"secondary":{"intro":{"es":"Cocina, pesca y primeros auxilios no ocupan lugar de profesión principal, y en Forever pesan más que en Classic: la comida da un stat según tu spec y +5% de experiencia, y las pociones de curación ahora son de Primeros Auxilios.","en":"Cooking, fishing and first aid don't take a main profession slot, and in Forever they matter more than in Classic: food gives a stat for your spec and +5% experience, and healing potions now belong to First Aid."},"cooking":[{"fact":{"es":"La mayoría de las comidas de Classic ahora da un solo stat en vez de Aguante y Espíritu, y el valor sube por nivel: +1 al 1, +3 al 5, +5 al 15, +10 al 25, +15 al 35 y +20 al 45.","en":"Most Classic foods now give a single stat instead of Stamina and Spirit, rising with level: +1 at 1, +3 at 5, +5 at 15, +10 at 25, +15 at 35 and +20 at 45."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"Con Well Fed la experiencia por matar sube 5%. Lo dice el tooltip del cliente; classicwowforever aclara que depende de una opción del servidor, así que falta confirmarlo para el lanzamiento.","en":"While Well Fed, experience from kills goes up 5%. The client tooltip says so; classicwowforever notes it depends on a server setting, so it's unconfirmed for launch."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"El buff dura 15 minutos. El perk de Legacy Gourmand lo alarga 33% (3 rangos).","en":"The buff lasts 15 minutes. The Legacy perk Gourmand makes it 33% longer (3 ranks)."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"Los licuados de Espíritu se compran con Merchant's Favor: Kalsey Sanden (Three Corners, Redridge) y Aza'bek (The Barrens), por 30 a 90 de Favor.","en":"Spirit smoothies are bought with Merchant's Favor: Kalsey Sanden (Three Corners, Redridge) and Aza'bek (The Barrens), for 30 to 90 Favor."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"},{"fact":{"es":"18 recetas necesitan el Iron Oven del campamento (se arma con Cocina 300). Los materiales crudos ahora se apilan de a 20.","en":"18 recipes need the camp's Iron Oven (built with Cooking 300). Raw cooking materials now stack to 20."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/cooking/"}],"firstAid":[{"fact":{"es":"Las pociones de curación pasaron de Alchemy a Primeros Auxilios, de Minor Healing Potion hasta Major Healing Potion.","en":"Healing potions moved from Alchemy to First Aid, from Minor Healing Potion up to Major Healing Potion."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/"},{"fact":{"es":"Hay curas nuevas: antídotos contra venenos, cataplasmas contra enfermedades y torniquetes contra sangrados, cada una hasta cierto nivel.","en":"There are new cures: anti-venoms for poisons, poultices for diseases and tourniquets for bleeds, each up to a set level."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/bandages/"},{"fact":{"es":"Su objeto de campamento, el First Aid Kit, da Aguante a los que se sientan junto al fuego.","en":"Its camp object, the First Aid Kit, gives Stamina to those sitting by the fire."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/best/"}],"fishing":[{"fact":{"es":"El Fish Bowl del campamento da +8% a todos los atributos durante una hora; no se suma con Blessing of Kings. Se aprende con Pesca 20 en la quest Camping 101: Fishing (Paxton Ganter, Dun Morogh).","en":"The camp's Fish Bowl gives +8% to all attributes for an hour; it doesn't stack with Blessing of Kings. Learned at Fishing 20 from the quest Camping 101: Fishing (Paxton Ganter, Dun Morogh)."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"Pesca abastece las comidas de poder de ataque y de daño con hechizos (Mightfish Steak, Baked Salmon, Lobster Stew), las mejores de su nivel para Enhancement y Elemental.","en":"Fishing supplies the attack power and spell damage foods (Mightfish Steak, Baked Salmon, Lobster Stew), the best of their level for Enhancement and Elemental."},"confidence":"client-data","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"El perk de Legacy Luremaster da 25% de chance de un pez extra si tenés un señuelo puesto (2 rangos).","en":"The Legacy perk Luremaster gives a 25% chance of an extra fish with a lure on (2 ranks)."},"confidence":"community-untested","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"},{"fact":{"es":"Señuelos: Shiny Bauble (+25, lo vende Kilxx en Booty Bay), Nightcrawlers y Bright Baubles (+50 a +75) y Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (+100 por 5 min).","en":"Lures: Shiny Bauble (+25, sold by Kilxx in Booty Bay), Nightcrawlers and Bright Baubles (+50 to +75) and Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (+100 for 5 min)."},"confidence":"classic-assumed","source":"https://classicwowforever.com/professions/fishing/"}]}}};
